# Brand conventions

## Single source of truth

- All colours, typography, and spacing come from `@anzuk/brand` (`packages/brand`).
- Never hardcode hex values in Astro components or pages.
- Use Tailwind utilities: `bg-anzuk-blue`, `text-anzuk-title`, `rounded-anzuk-button`, etc.
- Or CSS variables: `var(--anzuk-blue)`.

## Components

- UI primitives live in `src/components/ui/` — import these on all marketing pages.
- Core library: `Button`, `Logo`, `Section`, `Container`, `SectionHeading`, `Card`, `Badge`, `CountryCard`, `ValuePanel`, `FeatureCard`, `HeroHighlight`, `PartnerLogoGrid`.
- **Presentational bands** (`*Band.astro`, props-driven): the visual source of truth — e.g. `RegionGridBand`, `StatsBand`, `StepsRow`, `CtaBand`.
- **Strapi adapters** (`RegionGrid`, `StatsRow`, `ValuesGrid`, …): thin wrappers that accept `block: XBlock`, map CMS fields to presentational props, and delegate. Do not duplicate layout or motion markup in adapters.
- Strapi blocks in `src/components/marketing/` compose primitives — do not duplicate layout styles inline.
- Brand preview pages live under `src/pages/brand/` and must use the same primitives as marketing pages.

## Demo vs production chrome

- Demo-only: `DemoHeader`, `DemoFooter`, `DemoBackPill`, `demo.css` — used only via `DemoLayout` under `/brand/demo/`.
- Production: `SiteHeader`, `InternationalHeader`, `SiteFooter` with Strapi `market-navigation`. Do not import demo chrome on real pages.

## Tokens vs CMS

- **Static brand** (colours, fonts, logos): `packages/brand` in code
- **Marketing content** (copy, pages): Strapi `apps/cms`

## Brand guide

- Internal reference at `/brand` — always `noindex, nofollow` via `BrandLayout.astro`
- When adding new UI patterns, add a demo to `/brand/components`
